[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5881.189, "timestamp": "01:38:01", "text": "顺便提一下。所有这些尸体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5883.189, "timestamp": "01:38:03", "text": "不适合冒险者。他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5885.03, "timestamp": "01:38:05", "text": "更像是普通人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5886.55, "timestamp": "01:38:06", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5888.95, "timestamp": "01:38:08", "text": "它们都是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5891.83, "timestamp": "01:38:11", "text": "你知道，如果我加入了邪教，这些就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5893.43, "timestamp": "01:38:13", "text": "正是我会成为的那种人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5897.27, "timestamp": "01:38:17", "text": "为某事做出牺牲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5898.87, "timestamp": "01:38:18", "text": "这些人原本都不会在这里，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5900.94, "timestamp": "01:38:20", "text": "它们会被放进坩埚里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5906.87, "timestamp": "01:38:26", "text": "他们口袋里的钞票。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5910.229, "timestamp": "01:38:30", "text": "好的，笔记里有很多类似的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5911.91, "timestamp": "01:38:31", "text": "看起来很有科学性。有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5914.87, "timestamp": "01:38:34", "text": "方程式。但是，呃，我想做一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5916.55, "timestamp": "01:38:36", "text": "调查。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5917.59, "timestamp": "01:38:37", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5920.229, "timestamp": "01:38:40", "text": "为了解读这些笔记，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5922.87, "timestamp": "01:38:42", "text": "调查。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5924.39, "timestamp": "01:38:44", "text": "非常好的笔记。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5926.87, "timestamp": "01:38:46", "text": "好的。对，是笔记。有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5928.87, "timestamp": "01:38:48", "text": "你比他聪明太多了，但至少你知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5931.83, "timestamp": "01:38:51", "text": "那张纸条肯定不完整。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5934.709, "timestamp": "01:38:54", "text": "好的。嗯，我只是想拿走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time":